# Revert mashing: one revert per landing. Up the vert ramp, an Indy, back down fakie onto the
# ramp, then ; tapped every 2 ticks for half a second: one Revert (the next one needs another
# landing), the combo banks after the grace, Indy + Revert = 500. (Each revert used to reopen the
# grace for the next: 272 reverts and 835,040 points from one landing while the key was mashed.)
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
hold grab 208..212
tap revert 357..420 every 2
run 600
expect event revert count == 1
expect event revert within 357..359
expect event comboLanded{name=Indy + Revert,points=500,multiplier=2} within 368..372
expect no event bail
